# Managed by ailab: kubernetes/apps/apps/dsh/gitconfig.seed, installed to /dsh-home/.gitconfig by the
# seed-settings initContainer on EVERY pod creation. A hand edit here survives until the next pod
# roll and is then lost; the file is deployment-owned, like AGENTS.md beside it.
#
# One thing only: for git.chifor.me over HTTPS, ask git-credential-openbao, which reads the OpenBao
# credentials External Secrets projects into /dsh-credentials. Scoped to that one authority so the
# helper is consulted for nothing else -- see the helper's header for the whole story.
#
# Named by ABSOLUTE PATH, deliberately. gitcredentials(7) runs an absolute path as-is, so this does
# not depend on PATH surviving the sandbox's environment scrub. It must equal the install path in
# deployment.yaml's seed-settings script; scripts/tests/test_dsh_git_credential_helper.py pins that.
[credential "https://git.chifor.me"]
	helper = /dsh-home/.local/bin/git-credential-openbao
